cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Edictai data or software, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Edictai: AI in Education Policy in the United States"
abstract: >-
  An open dataset of artificial intelligence policy in US education, covering K-12 and
  higher education in the 50 states, the District of Columbia, and the federal government:
  legislation, agency guidance, executive actions, university system and accreditor policy,
  and research. Records are YAML files validated by JSON Schema and built into SQLite, CSV,
  and Parquet.
authors:
